<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Excel 반입 검증 결과</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/admin-data.css"></head><body class="admin-body"><main class="admin-main"><div class="page-heading-row"><div><p class="section-kicker">IMPORT PREVIEW</p><h1>Excel 반입 검증 결과</h1><p>개인정보는 마스킹되어 표시되며 원본 파일은 저장하지 않습니다.</p></div><a class="secondary-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/recipients">대상자 목록</a></div><c:if test="${param.completed != null}"><p class="alert alert-success">정상 행 반입을 완료하고 임시 암호문을 파기했습니다.</p></c:if><section class="work-panel"><div class="summary-grid"><div><strong>${preview.totalCount()}</strong><span>전체</span></div><div><strong>${preview.validCount()}</strong><span>정상</span></div><div><strong>${preview.duplicateCount()}</strong><span>중복</span></div><div><strong>${preview.errorCount()}</strong><span>오류</span></div></div><p>악성코드 검사: <c:out value="${preview.malwareScanStatus()}"/> · 상태: <c:out value="${preview.status()}"/></p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>행</th><th>이름</th><th>이메일</th><th>결과</th><th>오류 코드</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach var="row" items="${preview.rows()}"><tr><td>${row.rowNumber()}</td><td><c:out value="${row.maskedName()}"/></td><td><c:out value="${row.maskedEmail()}"/></td><td><c:out value="${row.status()}"/></td><td><c:out value="${row.errorCodes()}"/></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></div><c:if test="${preview.status() == 'VALIDATED'}"><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/recipients/import/${preview.batchId()}/confirm"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><button class="primary-button">정상 ${preview.validCount()}건 반입 확정</button></form></c:if></section></main></body></html>
